{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HerNwtz7Bt2upcRbDNw9VT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-13-0100-multistream-round0-parallel\n2\t\n3\tRound 0 constraint evaluation processes 623 AIRs sequentially on a single CUDA stream (cudaStreamPerThread). At APC 300, most AIRs are tiny (height 8-64), so each kernel uses 1-4 of the RTX 4090's 128 SMs — GPU throughput drops 10.7x per cell vs APC 0. By processing AIRs across N OS threads (each with its own per-thread CUDA stream), small kernels from different streams execute concurrently on idle SMs, recovering GPU utilization and overlapping CPU metadata preparation with GPU execution. This is expected to reduce Round 0 from ~663ms to ~500-565ms (15-25% improvement), yielding a 4-8% reduction in STARK excl trace at APC 300.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93785c5e-49ce-4ca5-bdce-28569746575a","uuid":"1680664c-4cc0-459c-bb60-d6cc539f2778","timestamp":"2026-04-12T23:13:02.528Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-13-0100-multistream-round0-parallel\n\nRound 0 constraint evaluation processes 623 AIRs sequentially on a single CUDA stream (cudaStreamPerThread). At APC 300, most AIRs are tiny (height 8-64), so each kernel uses 1-4 of the RTX 4090's 128 SMs — GPU throughput drops 10.7x per cell vs APC 0. By processing AIRs across N OS threads (each with its own per-thread CUDA stream), small kernels from different streams execute concurrently on idle SMs, recovering GPU utilization and overlapping CPU metadata preparation with GPU execution. This is expected to reduce Round 0 from ~663ms to ~500-565ms (15-25% improvement), yielding a 4-8% reduction in STARK excl trace at APC 300.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
