 results when it later calls fractional_sumcheck_gpu)\n- Are there any VPMM (virtual persistent memory manager) concerns with multi-threaded allocation?\n\nReturn your response in the format: Findings, Improvements, Assessment."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ro6v4k6ZAeVEeuJs6zqc5v","session_id":"93785c5e-49ce-4ca5-bdce-28569746575a","uuid":"580035eb-f318-4a20-ad13-cb03591c4220","timestamp":"2026-04-12T23:14:50.829Z"}
