{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015FX2CSFwJvWLdBBbxeZWYn","type":"tool_result","content":"autoopt-results/2026-04-13-0115-multistream-gkr-input-eval/plan.md:166:**Why**: Same approach as the successful Round 0 multi-stream. `std::thread::scope` with N threads, each with `cudaStreamPerThread` for concurrent kernel execution. The threshold of 100 AIRs avoids multi-threading at APC 0 (99 AIRs), preventing the memory pool contention issue observed in the Round 0 task.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-0115-multistream-gkr-input-eval/plan.md:186:4. **APC 0 no-regression**: The 100-AIR threshold ensures APC 0 (99 AIR instances across 5 segments, ~20 per segment) uses the sequential path. This avoids the memory pool contention issue observed in the Round 0 task.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-13-0100-multistream-round0-parallel/report.md:21:   - Added an AIR count threshold (`>= 100`) to avoid multi-threading when few large AIRs would cause memory pool contention without concurrent kernel benefits. Without this threshold, APC 0 (99 AIRs, ~20 per segment) showed a ~170ms regression in LogUp GKR due to multi-thread VPMM allocation patterns affecting subsequent memory pool behavior across segments.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-12-2130-pipeline-round0-kernel-launches/plan.md:5:Eliminate per-AIR GPU synchronization in the Round 0 constraint evaluation loop to allow the GPU to execute kernels back-to-back without CPU stalls. This targets the largest sub-component regression in \"STARK excl. trace\": Round 0 increases from 178ms (APC 0, 99 AIRs) to 662ms (APC 300, 623 AIRs) despite a >2x reduction in total cells and constraints.\nautoopt-results/2026-04-12-2130-pipeline-round0-kernel-launches/plan.md:255:- Round 0 at APC 0: roughly unchanged (only 99 AIRs, sync overhead is proportionally smaller)\nautoopt-results/2026-04-12-2245-parallelize-round0-cpu-postprocess/plan.md:284:- APC 0 (99 AIRs): minimal improvement (CPU overhead is small)\nautoopt-results/2026-04-12-2330-batch-stacked-reduction-mle-sync/plan.md:207:5. **APC 0 behavior**: At APC 0 with 99 AIR instances, there are fewer height groups, so fewer syncs are eliminated. The optimization should not regress APC 0 because: (a) the bulk upload of eq_ub_per_trace is tiny for few columns, (b) the single fill_zero + to_host per round is the same cost as the first window's operations in the current code.\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:26:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:28:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:223:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:251:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:286:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:287:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:291:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:292:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:293:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:299:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:305:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:378:{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"task_progress\",\"task_id\":\"aa47bdd26cf70413a\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01Ro6v4k6ZAeVEeuJs6zqc5v\",\"description\":\"Searching for 99 AIR|AIR.*instances.*99\",\"usage\":{\"total_tokens\":51414,\"tool_uses\":29,\"duration_ms\":91802},\"last_tool_name\":\"Grep\",\"uuid\":\"b36c8aa2-1aeb-439c-aaea-9c096174a365\",\"session_id\":\"93785c5e-49ce-4ca5-bdce-28569746575a\"}\nautoopt-results/logs/20260413-010314-5-1-plan.log:379:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260412-222319-3-2-do.log:12:[Omitted long matching line]\nautoopt-results/logs/20260412-215429-2-2-do.